This project is an independent, unofficial port of torph
(https://github.com/lochie/torph) to Jetpack Compose. It is not affiliated
with or endorsed by the torph project or its author.

The Kotlin source in this repository was written from scratch. It deliberately
reproduces torph's public API surface, option names, algorithms, and default
values so that torph configurations carry over directly.

